# Signing
#
# The release key is NOT in this repo. It lives in CI as a repository secret
# and is restored at build time; see RELEASING.md.
#
# The signing certificate is embedded in every published APK, so a key that sits
# in a public repo is a key anyone can use to sign an update. The key that was
# committed here was rotated when the repo went public.
keystore/
keystore.properties
